# Legacy redirects for old URL shapes, served by Workers Static Assets.
#
# Each path is listed with and without its trailing slash, because matching is
# exact. Workers Static Assets issues 307 for its own trailing-slash handling,
# and that status is not configurable, so "the site returns 307 sometimes" is
# expected and is a different mechanism from these 301s.
#
# `astro dev` does not read this file; check redirects with `wrangler dev`.

# The legacy roll endpoint, retired 2026-11-01 for the RANDSUM API. 308 keeps the
# method and body, so a POST of {"notation": "4d6L"} still rolls; the response
# is the /v1 shape.
/api/roll/                         https://api.randsum.dev/v1/roll     308
/api/roll                          https://api.randsum.dev/v1/roll     308

